*> Implementation test (T29501, US12-4; docs/protocol/30-redstone-5 section 8.1/8.2 and 30-redstone-3 section 5.4): the block table carries the note block instrument of each block (CB-INSTRUMENT, the
*> number of the 8.1 enumeration, from the Instrument column of 24, whose rows for the dyed collections say "see 5": terracotta basedrum, panes hat, carpet harp, banners bass) and the push reaction (CB-PUSH
*> 0 PUSH_PULL, 1 PUSH, 2 POPPED, 3 IMMOVEABLE: the Push column where it is filled, else the lists of 30-3 section 5.4). Needs the generated packs (skipped without them).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-BLOCKS-INSTRUMENT-PUSH.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CBLOCKS.
 01 WS-SKIP                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WANT                PIC X(48).
 01 WS-BARE                PIC X(48).
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-INST                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PUSH                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OBS-INST            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OBS-PUSH            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "PT-OPEN" USING WS-SKIP
     IF WS-SKIP = 1
         MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
         MOVE "implementation block instrument and push: no generated packs here, skipped" TO TL-CASE
         MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
         MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
         CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
         STOP RUN
     END-IF
     MOVE "note_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "stone" TO WS-WANT MOVE 1 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "dirt" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "glass" TO WS-WANT MOVE 3 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "sand" TO WS-WANT MOVE 2 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "gold_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 6 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "iron_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 10 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "clay" TO WS-WANT MOVE 5 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "soul_sand" TO WS-WANT MOVE 11 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "pumpkin" TO WS-WANT MOVE 12 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "emerald_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 13 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "hay_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 14 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "glowstone" TO WS-WANT MOVE 15 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "copper_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 16 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "packed_ice" TO WS-WANT MOVE 8 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "bone_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 9 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "zombie_head" TO WS-WANT MOVE 20 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_terracotta" TO WS-WANT MOVE 1 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_stained_glass_pane" TO WS-WANT MOVE 3 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_carpet" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_banner" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "black_wall_banner" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "slime_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "honey_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "obsidian" TO WS-WANT MOVE 1 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "nether_portal" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "piston" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "sticky_piston" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "piston_head" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "moving_piston" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "anvil" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 3 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_glazed_terracotta" TO WS-WANT MOVE 1 TO WS-INST MOVE 1 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "torch" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "redstone_wall_torch" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "lever" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "stone_button" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "oak_pressure_plate" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "oak_door" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "iron_door" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "oak_trapdoor" TO WS-WANT MOVE 4 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "red_tulip" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "potted_poppy" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "white_bed" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "redstone_wire" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "redstone_block" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 0 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     MOVE "water" TO WS-WANT MOVE 0 TO WS-INST MOVE 2 TO WS-PUSH PERFORM CHECK-BLOCK
     STOP RUN.

 CHECK-BLOCK.
*>   the block of key WS-WANT: instrument WS-INST, push reaction WS-PUSH
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FOUND
     MOVE -1 TO WS-OBS-INST WS-OBS-PUSH
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > CB-BLOCK-COUNT
         CALL "KEY-BARE" USING CB-KEY(WS-I) WS-BARE
         IF WS-BARE = WS-WANT
             MOVE CB-INSTRUMENT(WS-I) TO WS-OBS-INST
             MOVE CB-PUSH(WS-I) TO WS-OBS-PUSH
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "implementation block table instrument of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-WANT) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-INST TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OBS-INST TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-CASE
     STRING "implementation block table push reaction of " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-WANT) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-PUSH TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-OBS-PUSH TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-BLOCKS-INSTRUMENT-PUSH.

 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY PORTALTEST.
